<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαιτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ask besides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ καί νύ κεν . . ἄλλο μεῖζον
					ἐπαιτήσειας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.593
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧν ἐπαιτεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1416
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>ask for more,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαγὼν ἔτ᾽ ἐπῄτεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidipp.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.412e
			</span></i>:—so in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1124
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>beg as a mendicant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλους ἐ. τὸν καθ᾽ ἡμέραν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1364
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				715
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				68.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> simply,
				<i>demand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				26.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>, 
				Pass.
			), etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
